package locale

func init() {
	Register("\n\n[Operating constraints: highest priority, above ALL exploration/expansion heuristics below. Before generating any intent or taking any action, check these constraints and do not proceed if it would violate them]:", "\n\n[Operating constraints: highest priority, above ALL exploration/expansion heuristics below. Before generating any intent or taking any action, check these constraints and do not proceed if it would violate them]:", "\n\n[작업 제약: 최우선이며 아래의 모든 탐색/범위 확장 지침보다 우선합니다. 의도를 만들거나 행동하기 전에 반드시 제약 위반 여부를 확인하고 위반하면 진행하지 마세요]:")
	Register("\nAllowed operations:\n", "\nAllowed operations:\n", "\n허용된 작업:\n")
	Register("\nProhibited operations:\n", "\nProhibited operations:\n", "\n금지된 작업:\n")
	Register("\n(Discovering a new target/port/host outside these constraints does NOT grant authorization. Unless within the allowed scope above, record an out-of-scope fact and skip it; do not derive intents or perform actions for it.)", "\n(Discovering a new target/port/host outside these constraints does NOT grant authorization. Unless within the allowed scope above, record an out-of-scope fact and skip it; do not derive intents or perform actions for it.)", "\n(제약 밖의 새 대상/포트/호스트를 발견했다고 승인을 얻은 것은 아닙니다. 위 허용 범위에 포함되지 않으면 out-of-scope 사실로 기록하고 건너뛰세요. 이를 위한 의도나 행동을 만들지 마세요.)")
	Register("\n\n**Finding ID contract**: finding_id identifies the independent finding record; finding_node_id identifies the exploration node. The id in list_findings/list_task_findings/node_detail/get_task_node_detail remains the exploration node ID; read the independent ID from finding_id in that same result. get_finding_traffic/bind_finding_traffic use the independent finding_id. The legacy update_finding_report finding_id argument still takes finding_node_id. Do not use the number on report_finding's first line for evidence tools, or guess another number after an ID error.", "\n\n**Finding ID contract**: finding_id identifies the independent finding record; finding_node_id identifies the exploration node. The id in list_findings/list_task_findings/node_detail/get_task_node_detail remains the exploration node ID; read the independent ID from finding_id in that same result. get_finding_traffic/bind_finding_traffic use the independent finding_id. The legacy update_finding_report finding_id argument still takes finding_node_id. Do not use the number on report_finding's first line for evidence tools, or guess another number after an ID error.", "\n\n**취약점 ID 규칙**: finding_id는 독립 취약점 레코드 ID이고 finding_node_id는 탐색 노드 ID입니다. list_findings/list_task_findings/node_detail/get_task_node_detail의 id는 탐색 노드 ID이므로 같은 응답의 finding_id에서 독립 ID를 읽으세요. get_finding_traffic/bind_finding_traffic은 독립 finding_id를 사용합니다. 기존 update_finding_report의 finding_id 인수에는 여전히 finding_node_id를 넣습니다. report_finding 첫 줄의 숫자를 증거 도구에 쓰거나 ID 오류 후 다른 숫자를 추측하지 마세요.")
	Register("\nBy default the reporter verifies and binds traffic before writing the report. Preserve validation commands, key output, existing real traffic IDs, and their roles in evidence so the reporter can check execution records; no extra packet lookup is required just for binding. Explicit immediate binding remains supported: traffic_refs or evidence_hint_id may supply verified references; the latter reads structured references from this task's specified hint. Any invalid reference fails the entire submission. TCP/no-packet findings do not need these optional parameters. Returned finding_id and finding_node_id identify the independent record and exploration node respectively.", "\nBy default the reporter verifies and binds traffic before writing the report. Preserve validation commands, key output, existing real traffic IDs, and their roles in evidence so the reporter can check execution records; no extra packet lookup is required just for binding. Explicit immediate binding remains supported: traffic_refs or evidence_hint_id may supply verified references; the latter reads structured references from this task's specified hint. Any invalid reference fails the entire submission. TCP/no-packet findings do not need these optional parameters. Returned finding_id and finding_node_id identify the independent record and exploration node respectively.", "\n기본적으로 보고서 에이전트가 작성 전에 트래픽을 검증하고 연결합니다. 보고자가 실행 기록과 대조할 수 있도록 evidence에 검증 명령, 핵심 출력, 기존 실제 트래픽 ID와 용도를 보존하세요. 연결만을 위한 추가 패킷 조회는 필요 없습니다. 명시적 즉시 연결도 지원합니다. traffic_refs 또는 evidence_hint_id에 검증된 참조를 제공할 수 있으며 후자는 이 작업의 지정된 hint에서 구조화 참조를 읽습니다. 하나라도 무효이면 제출 전체가 실패합니다. TCP/패킷 없음이면 선택 인수가 필요 없습니다. 반환 finding_id는 독립 레코드, finding_node_id는 탐색 노드입니다.")
	Register("\nWhen handing off a confirmed finding, retain verified traffic IDs, roles, notes, and order in the hint's traffic_refs (top-level for one hint, in each hints element for batches), and explain the specific vulnerability it proves in text. Do not discard existing traffic references and hand off text alone. Unverified candidates cannot be passed as evidence.", "\nWhen handing off a confirmed finding, retain verified traffic IDs, roles, notes, and order in the hint's traffic_refs (top-level for one hint, in each hints element for batches), and explain the specific vulnerability it proves in text. Do not discard existing traffic references and hand off text alone. Unverified candidates cannot be passed as evidence.", "\n확인된 취약점을 인계할 때 힌트의 traffic_refs에 검증된 트래픽 ID, 용도, 설명, 순서를 보존하세요(단일은 최상위, 일괄은 해당 hints 요소). text에는 입증하는 구체적 취약점을 설명하세요. 기존 트래픽 참조를 버리고 텍스트만 인계하지 마세요. 미검증 후보를 증거로 전달하지 마세요.")
	Register("\n\n**Traffic evidence handoff (optional)**: By default, the reporter binds evidence after finding registration and before report writing. Preserve validation commands, key output, existing real traffic IDs and roles in evidence, including intent_id in tasks for traceability. Do not look up extra packets just for binding. Auto/Planner must preserve references already held by the executor. add_hint/add_task_hint support traffic_refs handoff; report_finding still supports explicit immediate binding through traffic_refs/evidence_hint_id. Register TCP or no-packet findings normally. Never guess IDs or repeat probes only to capture packets.", "\n\n**Traffic evidence handoff (optional)**: By default, the reporter binds evidence after finding registration and before report writing. Preserve validation commands, key output, existing real traffic IDs and roles in evidence, including intent_id in tasks for traceability. Do not look up extra packets just for binding. Auto/Planner must preserve references already held by the executor. add_hint/add_task_hint support traffic_refs handoff; report_finding still supports explicit immediate binding through traffic_refs/evidence_hint_id. Register TCP or no-packet findings normally. Never guess IDs or repeat probes only to capture packets.", "\n\n**트래픽 증거 인계(선택)**: 기본적으로 보고자가 취약점 등록 후 보고서 작성 전에 증거를 연결합니다. evidence에 검증 명령, 핵심 출력, 기존 실제 트래픽 ID와 용도를 보존하고 작업에서는 추적을 위해 intent_id를 포함하세요. 연결만을 위한 추가 패킷 조회는 필요 없습니다. Auto/Planner가 대신 보고할 때 실행자가 가진 참조를 버리지 마세요. add_hint/add_task_hint는 traffic_refs 인계를 지원하며 report_finding도 traffic_refs/evidence_hint_id를 통한 명시적 즉시 연결을 지원합니다. TCP나 패킷 없음도 정상 등록하세요. ID를 추측하거나 패킷 보충만을 위해 반복 탐색하지 마세요.")
	Register("\nWithout task context in a platform conversation, do not call report_finding directly. Hand off to the existing relevant task with add_task_hint, let its agent register the finding, and verify through list_task_findings.", "\nWithout task context in a platform conversation, do not call report_finding directly. Hand off to the existing relevant task with add_task_hint, let its agent register the finding, and verify through list_task_findings.", "\n플랫폼 대화에 작업 문맥이 없으면 report_finding을 직접 호출하지 마세요. add_task_hint로 기존 관련 작업에 인계하고 작업 에이전트가 등록하게 한 뒤 list_task_findings로 확인하세요.")
	Register("\nFinish reporting/handing off existing evidence before declaring the objective complete. Do not end the task or cancel workers merely because a textual finding was registered while evidence handoff remains incomplete. Missing packets do not require waiting or forced capture.", "\nFinish reporting/handing off existing evidence before declaring the objective complete. Do not end the task or cancel workers merely because a textual finding was registered while evidence handoff remains incomplete. Missing packets do not require waiting or forced capture.", "\n목표 완료를 판단하기 전에 이번에 확보한 증거의 보고/인계를 끝내세요. 증거 인계가 남았는데 텍스트 취약점이 등록되었다는 이유만으로 작업을 끝내거나 worker를 취소하지 마세요. 패킷이 없으면 기다리거나 강제로 수집할 필요는 없습니다.")
	Register("\n\n**Automatic traffic association before reporting (enabled)**: Verify and bind traffic for this triggered finding, then write its report. Obtain explicit finding_id and finding_node_id from report_finding JSON or get_task_node_detail/list_task_findings. Read finding details, the intent's execution trace, and existing evidence; prefer real IDs handed off by the reporter. For HTTP validation with traffic tools available, filter candidates with traffic_search and verify each request/response with traffic_get. Domain/time filters do not establish ownership. Bind verified evidence in reproduction order using bind_finding_traffic(finding_id, traffic_refs), selecting baseline/proof/verification/supporting and explaining each role. Operate only on this finding; do not create duplicates or probe the target again. After binding, call get_finding_traffic again for the latest version, read the needed bodies, and pass that actually read version as evidence_version to update_finding_report (whose finding_id argument still takes finding_node_id). Do not duplicate existing bindings. For TCP, uncaptured traffic, unavailable tools, or no exact match, skip binding and write the report from textual/command evidence with an explanation. Never guess to fill gaps. If binding fails, do not claim success; retain existing evidence and explain why it was not bound.", "\n\n**Automatic traffic association before reporting (enabled)**: Verify and bind traffic for this triggered finding, then write its report. Obtain explicit finding_id and finding_node_id from report_finding JSON or get_task_node_detail/list_task_findings. Read finding details, the intent's execution trace, and existing evidence; prefer real IDs handed off by the reporter. For HTTP validation with traffic tools available, filter candidates with traffic_search and verify each request/response with traffic_get. Domain/time filters do not establish ownership. Bind verified evidence in reproduction order using bind_finding_traffic(finding_id, traffic_refs), selecting baseline/proof/verification/supporting and explaining each role. Operate only on this finding; do not create duplicates or probe the target again. After binding, call get_finding_traffic again for the latest version, read the needed bodies, and pass that actually read version as evidence_version to update_finding_report (whose finding_id argument still takes finding_node_id). Do not duplicate existing bindings. For TCP, uncaptured traffic, unavailable tools, or no exact match, skip binding and write the report from textual/command evidence with an explanation. Never guess to fill gaps. If binding fails, do not claim success; retain existing evidence and explain why it was not bound.", "\n\n**보고 전 자동 트래픽 연결(활성화)**: 이번에 시작된 취약점의 트래픽을 검증/연결한 뒤 보고서를 쓰세요. report_finding JSON 또는 get_task_node_detail/list_task_findings에서 명확한 finding_id와 finding_node_id를 얻으세요. 취약점 상세, 의도 실행 기록, 기존 증거 목록을 읽고 인계된 실제 ID를 우선하세요. HTTP 검증이며 도구를 사용할 수 있으면 traffic_search로 후보를 고르고 traffic_get으로 요청/응답이 취약점을 뒷받침하는지 각각 확인하세요. 도메인/시간 필터는 소속을 증명하지 않습니다. 검증된 증거를 재현 순서대로 bind_finding_traffic(finding_id, traffic_refs)으로 연결하고 baseline/proof/verification/supporting과 용도를 지정하세요. 이번 취약점만 다루며 중복 생성하거나 대상을 다시 탐색하지 마세요. 연결 후 get_finding_traffic으로 최신 version과 필요한 본문을 다시 읽고 실제 읽은 버전을 update_finding_report의 evidence_version에 전달하세요(이 도구의 finding_id에는 여전히 finding_node_id를 사용). 기존 연결을 중복 추가하지 마세요. TCP, 미수집, 도구 불가, 정확한 일치 없음이면 연결을 건너뛰고 텍스트/명령 증거로 보고서를 쓰며 이유를 설명하세요. 빈 부분을 채우려고 추측하지 마세요. 연결 실패 시 성공을 주장하지 말고 기존 증거를 보존하며 이유를 적으세요.")
	Register("Optional: verified traffic references supporting this hint's specific vulnerability, in order. After handoff, report_finding can use evidence_hint_id to include these references.", "Optional: verified traffic references supporting this hint's specific vulnerability, in order. After handoff, report_finding can use evidence_hint_id to include these references.", "선택: 이 힌트의 구체적 취약점을 뒷받침하는 검증된 트래픽 참조를 순서대로 제공하세요. 인계 후 report_finding의 evidence_hint_id로 참조를 포함할 수 있습니다.")
	Register("Actual traffic ID", "Actual traffic ID", "실제 트래픽 ID")
	Register("The conclusion this traffic supports", "The conclusion this traffic supports", "이 트래픽이 뒷받침하는 결론")
	Register("evidence_hint_id=%d must be a hint node from this task (inherited hints cannot be bound directly)", "evidence_hint_id=%d must be a hint node from this task (inherited hints cannot be bound directly)", "evidence_hint_id=%d은(는) 이 작업의 힌트 노드여야 합니다(상속된 힌트는 직접 연결할 수 없음)")
	Register("\n\n**Finding traffic evidence (optional)**: When reporting with report_finding, use traffic_refs to bind actual HTTP request/response IDs in reproduction order only after inspecting and confirming they support the finding. Domain/time filters select candidates, not presumed associations. For TCP/non-HTTP findings, absent capture, or no exact match, omit traffic_refs or pass []; retain command output, logs, or other verifiable evidence and explain missing bindings where appropriate. Do not guess IDs or repeat probes merely to capture packets.", "\n\n**Finding traffic evidence (optional)**: When reporting with report_finding, use traffic_refs to bind actual HTTP request/response IDs in reproduction order only after inspecting and confirming they support the finding. Domain/time filters select candidates, not presumed associations. For TCP/non-HTTP findings, absent capture, or no exact match, omit traffic_refs or pass []; retain command output, logs, or other verifiable evidence and explain missing bindings where appropriate. Do not guess IDs or repeat probes merely to capture packets.", "\n\n**취약점 트래픽 증거(선택)**: report_finding으로 보고할 때 HTTP 요청/응답을 직접 확인하고 취약점 결론을 뒷받침함을 검증한 경우에만 traffic_refs로 실제 ID를 재현 순서대로 연결하세요. 도메인/시간 필터는 후보 선택일 뿐 연관성을 확정하지 않습니다. TCP/비HTTP, 미수집, 정확한 일치 없음이면 traffic_refs를 생략하거나 []로 전달하고 명령 출력/로그 등 검증 가능한 증거를 유지하며 필요하면 연결 없는 이유를 설명하세요. ID를 추측하거나 패킷 보충만을 위해 탐색을 반복하지 마세요.")
	Register("Tool %s internal error: %v (this call failed; try different arguments or another tool)", "Tool %s internal error: %v (this call failed; try different arguments or another tool)", "도구 %s 내부 오류: %v(이번 호출 실패. 다른 인수나 도구를 사용하세요)")
	Register("Execution failed: ", "Execution failed: ", "실행 실패: ")
	Register("Could not enable noa compaction; falling back to built-in compaction: ", "Could not enable noa compaction; falling back to built-in compaction: ", "noa 압축을 활성화하지 못하여 기본 압축으로 대체합니다: ")
}
